71610d63e4658a5f12ae.avif?t=1724952008\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414500/extras/21c0c22ff80b53726387f4053a7ca9b6.avif?t=1724952008\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414500/extras/4950c62b9aaf8c479e56add3823ff581.avif?t=1724952008\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Consume enemies to gain their abilities.<br></li><li> Use your frog-like tongue as a grappling hook or as a weapon.<br></li><li> Explore the world, unlock new paths and solve puzzles by using different acquired powers.<br></li><li> Find secrets and complete challenges.</li></ul>",
